  unitName: Creation God Odin (EU)
  unitId: 750317
  unitNumber: 7244
  description: "Odin is one of the most respected deities in Valhalla. Indeed, he
    and his wife are its undisputed sovereigns. Like all the other gods, he used
    his powers to create the Valkyries, but he notably created the first one. Many
    have heard of Odin\u2019s exploits as a powerful warrior. With his spear Gungnir,
    he is capable of destroying any creature. However, very few know the legend of
    his ultimate power of \u201CCreation\u201D. Indeed, Odin has created a great
    many life forms in hope of finding one that could protect Valhalla. A fear lurks
    behind this seemingly laudable wish. Nothing scares this god, except an old prophecy
    that foretells a cataclysmic event known as Ragnarok..."
  summonDesc: Valhalla is under my protection!
  fusionDesc: Ragnarok... What should I do...? Frigg...
